        {
          "height" : 21.8,
          "text" : "Following the continuous rail",
          "width" : 208.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 148.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "At the inlet, the team repeated the check. The reader carried the rule from the",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 173.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "outer shelf to the slot at the centre of the board. At the first station the front",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 185.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "edge rested against a shallow stop. A pencil line showed how far the tongue",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 197.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "could move before the spring began to bend. Turning the strip over exposed a",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 209.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "second line that had been hidden by the lip. The clerk entered both marks in the",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 221.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "same box and drew a short bar between them. A narrow gap beneath the board",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 233.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "let the strip settle after each reading. When the gauge returned to the shelf the",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 245.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "lower mark remained visible. The last entry records the position of the stop",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 257.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "after the board was lifted. At the first bend the narrow foot of the rule touched",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 269.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "the curved wall, so the team took the reading from the opposite bank. This",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 281.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "moved the observer without moving the gauge. A second slip carried a sketch",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 293.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "of the foot beside the curve. At the middle gate there was no room for the full",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 305.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "rule. The shorter rule had the same divisions but started at its cut end. The",
          "width" : 343.7,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 317.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "clerk copied the offset from the sketch before entering the next value. Beyond",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 329.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "the gate the shelf widened. Here both rules could lie flat, and the difference",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 341.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "between their readings matched the offset on the slip. On the return journey",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 353.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "the team left the gauge in place and changed only the direction from which the",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 365.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "marks were read. The two entries agreed at the straight stations. At the bend",
          "width" : 343.8,
          "x" : 125.4,
          "y" : 377.2
        },
        {
          "height" : 14.8,
          "text" : "they differed by half a division, the width of the pencil line itself. The final",
